{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>《Menu Bar Notes》是一款以選單列快速記事為核心的筆記工具，適合需要隨時記下想法或參考資料，並在 Mac、iPhone 與 iPad 之間同步的使用者。原價 US $4.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n\n<h2>選單列記事與私密同步</h2>\n<p>這款工具讓 Mac 用家在選單列隨時開啟記事，按下 ⌥⌘N 即可快速捕捉靈感；筆記以區塊組成，支援標題、摺疊選單、待辦清單與程式碼，亦可用 Markdown 快捷鍵即時轉換。記事會以分頁顯示，並透過私人 iCloud 在 iPhone、iPad 與 Mac 之間同步，刪除內容可在垃圾桶保留 30 天。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1320x2868bb-467-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1320x2868bb-468-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1320x2868bb-469-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1320x2868bb-470-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1320x2868bb-471-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1320x2868bb-472-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Menu Bar Notes: Quick Capture</li>\n<li>應用類別：Productivity</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-24T09:58:28.858365+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":332,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}